{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/insidechicagowalkingtours/items/335819/", "pk": 335819, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/insidechicagowalkingtours/", "pk": 40287, "shortname": "insidechicagowalkingtours", "name": "Inside Chicago Walking Tours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Chicago in the Roaring '20s: Art Deco, Flappers, Gangsters, & Prohibition", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 11, "unicode": "Chicago in the Roaring '20s: Art Deco, Flappers, Gangsters, & Prohibition", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 2.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 16000, "description": "#Discover Chicago of the Roaring '20s through its buildings & stories!\n\nThis tour is the answer to many requests for an Art-Deco-specific tour because — let's face it — we all LOVE the elegance, glam, and glitz of the 1920s. This 2-hour walking tour explores the interiors and exteriors of gorgeous buildings from this surprisingly brief architectural period in Chicago, with some interesting details and stories about life in that era. Flappers, gangsters, jazz, speakeasies — we'll pepper those throughout our larger exploration of Chicago's magnificent Art Deco buildings in order to truly set the context for you!\n\n**Inside Chicago Walking Tours** brings you back in time on this much-anticipated tour.  You’ll walk in the footsteps of those high on the potential of the future, before the infamous Crash of ‘29.  You’ll understand why the Art Deco style is so timeless — why even for us, it has a stunning beauty that inspires us to this day.  In addition to experiencing magnificent Art Deco architectural interiors, you’ll also learn about Chicago’s notorious gangster history — even ending the tour inside an old gangster headquarters surrounded by real photographs, newspapers, and an old uncovered vault!\n\nLet **Inside Chicago Walking Tours** take you back in time, and enjoy these interior spaces that evoke thoughts of Metropolis, The Great Gatsby, and even Gotham City (we’ll explain that one…). Staying almost entirely within the downtown Loop neighborhood, and ending just across the river in River North, we’ll explore the elegance of this fascinating period in Chicago’s history.  Come join us on our newest tour!\n\n## Duration\n\n2 Hours\n*1.5 miles on foot*\n\n\n## Highlights of the Tour\n\n - Great-Gatsby-esque interiors that throw you back in time;\n - Stories of Capone's enemies and successors, with lots of archival photos & news articles;\n - Gleaming marble, brushed metal, and other materials that celebrate the potential of the future;\n - Much, much more!\n\n\n\n## Tour Details\n\n - Runs rain or shine! We will be in touch in case of severe weather.\n - **Meeting Location:** Refer to ticket confirmation for address.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Chicago Loop, Riverwalk, and River North", "booking_notes": "###What to Bring:\n\n - Comfortable clothing and shoes\n - Camera\n - Umbrella if needed\n - Bottle of water if needed\n - Extra cash for gratuities for your guide (optional, but appreciated!)\n_______\n\n###Please arrive at least 5 minutes prior to the scheduled tour time.  Your guide will b